            "type": "callout",
            "tone": "definition",
            "title": "Feedback mechanism",
            "text": "A feedback mechanism is one in which a controlling mechanism is itself controlled by the product of the process it controls. The endocrine system is regulated by feedback mechanisms of two kinds, positive and negative."
          }
        ]
      }
